OL,3,GNEWSAResidential firm fined over fire
OL,4,Asafety breaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FA residential company has been fined
OL,7,F#153,000 over fire safety failures at a
OL,8,Fblock of flats in Leeds.
OL,10,FScanlans Property Management LLP
OL,11,Fpleaded guilty to failing to comply
OL,12,Fwith an enforcement notice over a
OL,13,Fdefective fire alarm system and
OL,14,Fincorrect evacuation signs at Ahlux
OL,15,FHouse.
OL,17,FJudge Helen Pitts also ordered the
OL,18,Fcompany to pay costs totalling more
OL,19,Fthan #13,000 at a sentencing hearing at
OL,20,FKirklees Magistrates' Court on
OL,21,FThursday.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
