OL,3,GNEWSAResidential firm fined over fire
OL,4,Asafety breaches
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Yorkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,F(WYFRS) said it took action following
OL,8,Flongstanding and unresolved concerns
OL,9,Fabout the safety system, with crew
OL,10,Fhaving to attend a number of false
OL,11,Falarms at the premises.
